<title>UK: Glynwed gains as BZW raises to &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Glynwed gains as BZW raises to &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Glynwed International Plc nudged higher on Wedesday as analysts at BZW raised the metals, pipes and Aga cookers company to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold,&quot; market sources said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 2p at 332 by 1311 GMT in volume of 258,271 shares, after earlier rising as high as 335p. Analysts at BZW were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Shares in Glynwed hit a four-month low of 324p on November 15.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
